Picks carried in D files: 0 graded (lists were built from the sheet, not the D file; real bets live in props-finder/user_bets, kept separate).

Slices with < 5 games get no verdict: a game-clustered CI needs more clusters. Read the pooled rows. PENDING_no_box = box score not posted yet (re-run grade.py).

z-CLV is in logit units: +0.04 is about +1 point of probability near 50%. A sample this size cannot separate a 1-2 point edge from zero.

## Early closes (book pulled lines early): kept out of every CLV number

A game is an early close when the last close-window snapshot with lines was more than 5 min before puck drop and later snapshots came back empty (the book pulled the board). Its close is really an early price, so those rows are excluded from every z-CLV / closing-line figure in this report (CLV table, model-only, Fliff list). Win/loss and units still count. z-CLV against that early price is shown here for the record only.

